Bind Npc 13013 Zone 21
Quest 65 "Kecoon hunting"
    Journal "[Sentinel] Patrick asked me to hunt five Kecoons for him."
    Kill 5 of 150 at direction_11

Requires player level >= 6

Rewards
    Give 1875 experience
    Give 2000 coins
    Choose one
        Give 1 of 330150005
        Give 1 of 330150015
        Give 1 of 330150025
        Give 1 of 330150035
        Give 1 of 330150075

direction_11 = location "Kecoon" about "Kecoon\nBipedal insect evolved from the war against Pathos" found "Moradon lakefront" at 616 341 in zone 21

On available
    Say "Master, [Sentinel] Patrick looks preoccupied again."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "For the protection of Moradon... What is it you wanted to say to me?"
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "Peddlers that have arrived recently say they were attacked by Kecoons en route to the castle. Kecoons are malicious monsters who attack humans and take their belongings. Say, do you mind venturing to the outskirts of Moradon and teaching them a lesson?"

On in_progress
    Say "Your ability is wasted. Don't you need to catch this much at least?"
    Topic "Where can I find it?" do
        Map direction_11

On ready
    Say "Master, I caught all of the Kecoons as promised. Let's go back to [Sentinel] Patrick."
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "Thanks to you the number of Kecoons dwelling in the village outskirts have been reduced significantly. Thank you. I'll ask for your help again next time."
